+// coop-eventslots (Jep's 11-11 playtest item 1: both players use the fishing board at once): every static of the town's one event
+// engine, as (address, bytes, name) ranges, for a player's parked event slot (port/src/coop/coop_eventslots.cpp) to exchange with
+// the live ones around that player's own event's start, steps and draw. The town-wide parts (the villagers' appear and restore
+// tables, the talk statics: EdTalkStateSwap) are left out.
+void EdEventStateRanges(void (*add)(void *at, std::size_t bytes, const char *name, void *context), void *context) {
+#define ED_EVENT_RANGE(x) add(static_cast<void *>(&(x)), sizeof(x), #x, context)
